<title>UK: Waterschapsbank sets 1.0 bln Ffr 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Waterschapsbank sets 1.0 bln Ffr 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEDERLANDSE WATERSCHAPSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    28.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.87    PAY DATE    28.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.195    SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS/AMS PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100-1M    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED OCT 2006 AND OCT 2008 OATS -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
